      "message": "feat(results): update Mem0 Platform benchmark results with v3 + temporal reasoning (#8)\n\nUpdate LongMemEval and LoCoMo results to reflect the v3 algorithm with\ntemporal reasoning always-on. LongMemEval overall improves from 90.4%\nto 94.8% at top_50 and 93.4% to 94.4% at top_200. LoCoMo overall\nimproves to 92.5% at top_200 and 91.8% at top_50, with the largest\ncategory gains in temporal (+6.7 pts) and multi-hop (+6.9 pts).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
